#. Description of the plugin
#: madeit-vouchers.php
msgid "Sell gift vouchers with a balance in WooCommerce. Customers receive a PDF with a code and can spend it across several orders."
msgstr "Sprzedawaj vouchery podarunkowe z saldem w WooCommerce. Klient dostaje PDF z kodem i może wykorzystać saldo w kilku zamówieniach."

